---
/**
 * A restrained Daily Challenge entry point for game pages.
 *
 * The post-game dialog already nudges players who finish a deal; this catches
 * the much larger group who never reach an end state. It renders below the
 * board with static, always-true copy, then `initDailyStrip()` fills in the
 * day's actual game and the player's streak — same box either way, so there is
 * no layout shift and no flash of wrong state.
 *
 * Hidden entirely while the player is already playing the daily.
 */
---

<aside class="daily-strip" data-daily-strip aria-label="Daily Challenge">
  <a
    class="daily-strip-link"
    href="/daily-challenge/"
    data-daily-strip-link
    data-ch-track="daily"
    data-ch-placement="game_page"
  >
    <span class="daily-strip-icon" aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
    <span class="daily-strip-body">
      <span class="daily-strip-title" data-daily-strip-title>Daily Challenge</span>
      <span class="daily-strip-status" data-daily-strip-status>
        One puzzle a day, the same for everyone — build a streak.
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="daily-strip-go" aria-hidden="true">Play →</span>
  </a>
</aside>
